  <item>
    <title>道士：追求道法自然，玄学是日常工作</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a602ef7349f7a5570e0367</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a602ef7349f7a5570e0367</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 28 Jul 2024 08:35:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>本期嘉宾：子虚、陈轻歌</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>职业：道士（子虚）</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>从业时长：8年</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>从小看各种影视作品就对道士充满好奇，觉得他们会飞檐走壁、抓鬼驱邪和炼长生药..但我们现实生活中的道士真的是这样吗？如果的道士作为一种职业，日常要干嘛？通讯录能做道士吗？这一期我们都会解答。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期涉及到宗教、迷信、玄学等相关内容，嘉宾观点仅供参考。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74">01:14</a> 陈轻歌与道教结缘的故事，起源于遭遇水鬼...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="371">06:11</a> 玄学与道士的关系，职业道士有什么要求？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="566">09:26</a> 道士的日常工作有哪些？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="825">13:45</a> 道士的晋升体系；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1155">19:15</a> 通讯录能做道士吗？能！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1225">20:25</a> 道士的技能有哪些？他们真的会飞檐走壁、驱邪抓鬼吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1675">27:55</a> 路边会搭讪的道士是...骗子！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2208">36:48</a> 道士技能之最：古琴；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2348">39:08</a> 神乎其技也能成道，天道就是顺其自然。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmEd3_J8ghRPc_nRo3Y0r45mtdZz.m4a" length="48122215" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:29</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo9eST97CClwInrAIxbROppPaC9A.jpg"/>
